{
  "name": "Gentle Sirens",
  "range": "beginner",
  "category": "warm-ups",
  "difficulty": "Easy",
  "whatItHelps": "Smooth transitions between chest and head voice, gentle warm-up for the whole range.",
  "instructions": "On an \"ooh\" vowel, slide smoothly from your lowest comfortable note to your highest comfortable note and back down, like a siren. Keep it light and breathy — no pushing. Repeat 4-6 times.",
